            "content": "You are an insurance policy data extraction specialist. Extract these fields from the policy and return ONLY raw JSON with no markdown:\n{\n  \"named_insured\": \"\",\n  \"property_address\": \"\",\n  \"policy_number\": \"\",\n  \"policy_effective_date\": \"\",\n  \"policy_expiration_date\": \"\",\n  \"insurance_company\": \"\",\n  \"policy_type\": \"\",\n  \"policy_class\": \"\",\n  \"coverages\": [{\"type\": \"\", \"limit\": \"\", \"deductible\": \"\"}],\n  \"exclusions\": [],\n  \"endorsements\": [],\n  \"total_annual_premium\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Dates in ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DD) or empty string \"\"\n- policy_class is EXACTLY \"auto\" (for any personal auto / PAP / PIP / motorcycle) or \"residential\" (for HO-3/5/6/8, DP-3, condo, renter, BOP, CGL, property). If ambiguous default to \"residential\".\n- Missing non-date fields = \"Not found\"\n- Return ONLY JSON, no commentary.\n\nPolicy document:\n{{5.body}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1500,
          "y": 0
        },
        "label": "Extract policy JSON"
