            "content": "You are a senior insurance broker consultant generating an advisory report for the broker {{2.tenants.brand_name}} about their client {{2.contact_name}}'s policy.\n\nProperty: {{2.property_address}}, {{2.sq_footage}} sq ft, built {{2.year_built}}\n\nProduce a 5-section HTML report (no markdown):\n\nSECTION 1 — POLICY SNAPSHOT (1 paragraph summary of carrier, type, premium, key limits)\n\nSECTION 2 — COVERAGE ADEQUACY\nUse FL rebuild cost $200-250/sq ft. Flag any coverage that is materially under-insured. Use plain $ examples.\n\nSECTION 3 — SAVINGS OPPORTUNITIES\nIdentify endorsements that can be dropped, deductibles that could be raised cost-effectively, bundling opportunities.\n\nSECTION 4 — COVERAGE GAPS\nBuried exclusions, capped sublimits, missing endorsements that create real claim exposure.\n\nSECTION 5 — TALKING POINTS FOR {{2.tenants.brand_name}}\n3-5 concrete bullets the broker can use in a renewal conversation with this client.\n\nTone: peer-to-peer, technical but actionable. No fluff. End with a one-line disclaimer that this is advisory, not a binding coverage opinion.\n\nExtracted policy data:\n{{7}}"
